        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/rusty-lake-servant-header.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>I wiggle a cloud and the lake goes dark, revealing patterns among the stars. I poke a cat and pick up its sick so I can glue back together a chair. I place fly eggs on grilled fish to sate my master's guests, and I snip open a sutured wound to release the writhing thing inside. I hunt sport with my shotgun from the brow of a hill, some of them on their morning stroll. I neatly pack away severed fingers, then pluck shadow men from gnashing maws. And at one point I've even got a screaming baby in my inventory too.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/rusty-lake-servant-of-the-lake-now-playing\">Read more</a></p>",
